tion":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"S'il y a un moment où tu peux travailler ta technique de course, c'est bien en footing ! Prends le temps de penser à un détail que tu souhaites améliorer (voir ici pour 10 points techniques intéressants : https://youtu.be/pP7TCO3kqoM) et concentre toi dessus. Pas sur plusieurs, sur un seul à la fois pour que ce soit vraiment efficace !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1787529600000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.017543859649122,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"VMA_600_2","description":"Classique séance de VMA, le 30/30 c'est l'enchaînement de 30\" à ton allure VMA (calculée par nos soins) suivies de 30\" de footing lent. Au total, tu enchaînes 10 fois les 30\" rapides et 30\" lentes.","displayName":"Vitesse Maximale Aérobie (VMA)","coachAdvice":"Ne va pas trop vite sur les premiers intervalles. Il vaut mieux être un peu en retard le temps de trouver ton rythme. Les intervalles en fin de séance sont souvent plus longs qu'on ne le pense ! Et ça sera d'autant plus long si tu as gaspillé ton énergie sur les premiers intervalles. Savoir gérer ton effort est une compétence importante à acquérir en tant que coureur(se).","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":10,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"VMA_0.5","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VMA","value":212,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":false,"slug":"vma"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_0.5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":598,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,"t