d":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Un autre footing ? Oui mais sur celui-là écoute encore plus tes sensations que d'habitude ! Es-tu aussi facile que d'habitude ? Ou est-ce que la fatigue pointe le bout de son nez et rend la fin de footing plus difficile ? Si c'est le cas, fais attention à la suite de la semaine, tu es dans un état qui fait progresser mais qui peut aussi vite se retourner contre toi si tu vas trop loin dans cette fatigue !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.017543859649122,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"VMA_600_3","description":"**Séance VMA en deux blocs**. Le 45/45 c'est l'enchaînement de 45\" à ton allure VMA *(calculée par nos soins)* suivies de 45\" de footing lent. Sur le premier bloc tu enchaîneras 5 fois les 45\" rapides et 45\" lent puis tu prendras 4' *(soit 3'15 de bonus !)* pour repartir ensuite sur le second bloc identique.","displayName":"Vitesse Maximale Aérobie (VMA)","coachAdvice":"On avance petit à petit dans le cycle, les séances commencent à te mettre à l'épreuve. Moins tu seras crispé(e) dans l'effort, mieux ça se passera pour toi.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":5,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"VMA_0.75","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VMA","value":212,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":false,"slug":"vma"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"RECUP_3.25","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":195,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":5,"exercises":[